ay station. The temple complex occupies nearly 2.0\u00a0ha.", "extract_html": "<p><b>Sunandarama Maha Vihara</b>, also known as <b>Maha pansala</b>, is located in the southern part of Sri Lanka. It is situated 65\u00a0km (40\u00a0mi) south of Colombo, 36\u00a0km (22\u00a0mi) south of Galle and 200\u00a0m (660\u00a0ft) east from Ambalangoda railway station. The temple complex occupies nearly 2.0\u00a0ha.</p>"}